    "badge": "New!",
    "shortInfo": "National Testing Agency (NTA) has released the Result / Score Card on its official website for the exam of UGC National Eligibility Test NET Assistant Professor / JRF June 2026 Examination. The Re-Exam was conducted on 09 - 10 September 2026 , The NTA application process started on 29 April 2026 , and candidates were able to submit their applications until 24 May 2026 . Candidates can download their Result / Score Card using their Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.",
